{'symbol': 'ACN', 'date': '2023-06-07 05:00:00', 'title': 'IMMERSIVE LABS AND ACCENTURE COLLABORATE TO SOLVE THE GLOBAL CYBER TALENT SHORTAGE', 'text': 'BRISTOL, ENGLAND & NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IMMERSIVE LABS, A LEADER IN PEOPLE-CENTRIC CYBER RESILIENCE, AND ACCENTURE (NYSE: ACN) ARE WORKING TOGETHER TO LAUNCH THE CYBER MILLION PROGRAM THAT AIMS TO SOLVE THE CYBERSECURITY TALENT DEFICIT BY INCREASING ACCESS TO ONE MILLION ENTRY-LEVEL CYBERSECURITY OPERATIONS JOBS OVER THE NEXT DECADE. THE BETA VERSION OF THE PROGRAM, ROLLING OUT TODAY, WILL BE POWERED BY THE IMMERSIVE LABS PLATFORM WITH ACCENTURE SECURITY SERVING AS THE FIRST FOUNDATIONAL.'}